UID:seed-jerash@amman2026
DTSTAMP:20260705T112304Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20260726
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20260727
SUMMARY:🏺 Jerash Roman ruins
DESCRIPTION:One of the best-preserved Roman cities anywhere — colonnaded 
 streets\, temples\, its own grand theater\, and the huge Oval Plaza. ~1 
 hr from Amman.
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:seed-petra@amman2026
DTSTAMP:20260705T112304Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20260728
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20260729
SUMMARY:🏜️ Petra — the Treasury & beyond
DESCRIPTION:Walk the Siq to the Treasury\, then the Street of Facades and
  the Royal Tombs. Start early — a long day\, and Wadi Rum can follow the
  same evening. ~3 hrs from Amman.
END:VEVENT
